'''Iceflake''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually from the [[Iceflake Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or from the [[Ice Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Christmas Event 2021|2021 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the [[gamepasses]] have since went offsale.

==Appearance==
Its blade is a large chunk of ice with four indents on each side, along with a diamond-cut design in the center of it with a gradient from a icy blue to a lilac. Wrapped around the ricasso of the blade is a snowflake with sharp edges that has a tiny gemstone placed in the middle of it. The handle is purple with a purple tape-wrapped texture over it with a pommel crafted out of sharp ice.

==Trivia== 
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Icebeam]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Iceflake_Set Iceflake Set].
*This and its partner gun are the first gamepass weapons where you had the option to buy it as part of a bundle or separately.
* It was a victim of the [[The Duping Glitch (2022)|Duping Glitch (2022)]], along with [[Icebeam]], [[Plasmablade]] and [[Plasmabeam]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

